# Docker build context excludes for the Python backend image.
#
# Why this file exists: without it the build context was 2.2 GB across ~63,800
# files, which is uploaded to Fly's remote builder on every single deploy. That
# upload repeatedly timed out ("deadline_exceeded: context deadline exceeded")
# and no deploy could complete.
#
# This repo holds both a React frontend and the FastAPI backend, but the image
# built here is backend-only. The four entries below are ~2.16 GB of the 2.2 GB
# and none of them are read by the backend at runtime (app/ mounts no
# StaticFiles; nothing in app/ serves public/ or dist/).

# Frontend build output and dependencies — not used by the Python image
node_modules/
dist/
public/

# Version control history
.git/
.github/

# Local env files — secrets come from Fly app secrets, never the image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python caches / local virtualenvs
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Test + docs artifacts not needed at runtime
playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/

# Additional paths excluded by the backend-only image: none of these are
# read at runtime, and dropping them cut the context to ~7.9 MB.
docs/
src/
tests/
data/
db/
field-app/
ai-page-blueprints/
site-blueprints/
templates/
*.md
.env*
!requirements.txt
*.pyc
